      "value": "Solve the following system of linear equations by finding the inverse of the coefficient matrix:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y+z=1 \\\\ 2x-2z=2+2y \\\\ 2y+4z=2x-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind  $x+y+z.$",
